  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n* Add temporary obsoletion messages for DatePickerDialog and TimePickerDialog by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/471\n* Add TreeDataGrid demo with table and tree examples by @klorman in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/473\n* Add keyboard focus visual indicator for ToggleSwitch control. by @c3n9 in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/476\n* Add keyboard focus visual indicator for some controls by @c3n9 in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/477\n* ComboBox alignment adjustments to properly center values by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/480\n\n## New Contributors\n* @c3n9 made their first contribution in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/476\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/compare/v3.13.0...v3.13.1",
